@startuml domain_model_excerpt
title Domain Model Excerpt - BCK10 Predefined Pizza Management
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
hide methods

package "Product Aggregate (BCK05)" {
  class Product <<aggregateRoot>> {
    +isActive : boolean
  }
  class SellableProduct <<entity>>
  class PredefinedPizza <<entity>>
  class PizzaComponent <<entity>>
  class ProductId <<value object>> {
    +value : string
  }
  class ProductCompositionItem <<value object>>
  class Quantity <<value object>> {
    +amount : int
  }
  Product <|-- SellableProduct
  SellableProduct <|-- PredefinedPizza
  Product <|-- PizzaComponent
  Product "1" *-- "1" ProductId : identity >
  Product "1" *-- "0..*" ProductCompositionItem : default recipe >
  ProductCompositionItem "0..*" --> "1" Product : child Product >
  ProductCompositionItem "1" *-- "1" Quantity : quantity >
  note right of PredefinedPizza
    A PredefinedPizza is a Sellable Product,
    not also a Pizza Component. It uses the
    ProductId and Product composition. It has
    no separate ID or second configuration.
  end note
  note bottom of ProductCompositionItem
    BCK10 includes each component Product at most once.
    Its quantity is 1 in this story; the per-size
    consumption is defined separately by BCK08.
  end note
}

package "Pizza Component Type Aggregate (BCK07)" {
  class PizzaComponentType <<aggregateRoot>>
  class ComponentTypeId <<value object>> {
    +value : string
  }
  PizzaComponentType "1" *-- "1" ComponentTypeId
}
package "Component Size Configuration Aggregate (BCK08)" {
  class ComponentSizeConfiguration <<aggregateRoot>>
}
package "Pizza Size Aggregate (BCK06)" {
  class PizzaSize <<aggregateRoot>>
  class PizzaSizeId <<value object>> {
    +id : string
  }
  PizzaSize "1" *-- "1" PizzaSizeId
}

Product "0..*" --> "0..1" PizzaComponentType : component role >
ComponentSizeConfiguration "0..*" --> "1" Product : configures component >
ComponentSizeConfiguration "0..*" --> "1" PizzaSize : for size >

note bottom of Product
  BCK05 owns Product identity and aggregate lifecycle.
  BCK10 defines/validates the PredefinedPizza subtype
  and default Product composition through a BCK05-owned
  application contract. All IDs remain Product IDs.
end note
@enduml
